   "label": "Look (every shot)",
   "parent": "",
   "text": "The same house in every shot: a modern house cantilevered over the edge of a rocky granite cliff, board-formed concrete core and piers, a warm larch-clad volume with vertical battens on thin steel struts, white fibre-cement panels, a dark standing-seam zinc tower, a timber deck terrace with a glass-sided pool of turquoise water, pine trees on the plateau, snow patches and dry winter grass on the rocks, soft warm overcast winter light at dusk, warm light glowing in the windows, high-end architectural photography."
